---
<section class="section section--light" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">About</h2>
    <div class="about">
      <p class="about__statement">Outside of work, I’m a triathlete and a helicopter pilot.</p>
      <div class="about__copy">
        <p class="about__text">
          I’m based in New Zealand. At Henry Schein One I work on Dentally, where I lead large complex projects, improve developer experience, and mentor junior developers.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <dl class="about__facts">
      <div>
        <dt>Role</dt>
        <dd>Developer, Henry Schein One</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Product</dt>
        <dd>Dentally</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Usually writing</dt>
        <dd>Ruby on Rails, Ember, C# / ASP.NET</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Off the clock</dt>
        <dd>Triathlon, helicopters</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>
